{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2021-05-06 19:57:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ANNOUNCES PRICING OF $1 BILLION PREFERRED STOCK DEPOSITARY SHARES OFFERING AND $500 MILLION 2.100% SENIOR NOTES OFFERING', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF., MAY 6, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SVB FINANCIAL GROUP ("SVB") (NASDAQ: SIVB) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF AN UNDERWRITTEN OFFERING OF 1,000,000\xa0DEPOSITARY SHARES, EACH REPRESENTING A 1/100TH\xa0INTEREST IN A SHARE OF ITS SERIES C NON-CUMULATIVE PERPETUAL PREFERRED STOCK, LIQUIDATION AMOUNT\xa0$100,000\xa0PER SHARE (EQUIVALENT TO\xa0$1,000\xa0PER DEPOSITARY SHARE) AT AN AGGREGATE OFFERING PRICE OF\xa0$1 BILLION.'}